      "writtenOn": "2025-12-16T16:23:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Looks like we have a greedy strategy: grab as many pages as we can, even if we need less?\n\nWhy not take just as many as we need, i.e. set min_pages to host_mc-\u003enr_pages, like in pvMMU?",
      "revId": "303341375ffa9686415f38b80a3b54ea7ee9ab06",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
