      "side": 1,
      "message": "Sorry the percentage is wrong. Its less than .1% for most devices and for graphics its around 1%. From my profiling:\n```\n127|felino:/ # grep maps /sys/kernel/debug/iommu/intel/*/domain_translation_struct | grep -v \"maps: 0\"\nDev[0000:00:02.0] maps: 28670, map_retries: 50, unmaps: 27030, donations: 387\nDev[0000:00:05.0] maps: 75, map_retries: 2, unmaps: 9, donations: 10\nDev[0000:00:0d.0] maps: 26522, map_retries: 2, unmaps: 886, donations: 10\nDev[0000:00:0d.3] maps: 26522, map_retries: 2, unmaps: 886, donations: 10\nDev[0000:00:14.0] maps: 153667, map_retries: 2, unmaps: 153586, donations: 10\nDev[0000:00:14.2] maps: 153667, map_retries: 2, unmaps: 153586, donations: 10\nDev[0000:00:14.3] maps: 35989, map_retries: 8, unmaps: 27111, donations: 40\nDev[0000:01:00.0] maps: 822717, map_retries: 12, unmaps: 189496, donations: 60\n\n```",
